# File capabilities for alfred (saphira-permissions V1).
#
# Least privilege by construction: the binary carries only the two
# capabilities alfred retains across its setuid drop (netlink query
# + raw multicast sockets). Both service units start it as alfred.
# Declared here instead of build-time setcap so the authority
# survives in the package as a caps.d fragment (APK records no
# capability state): install, upgrade, and ensure-permissions
# --system all converge from this declaration via ensure-caps. r3
# migration (setcap line removed from recipe_install the same
# revision).
cap /usr/sbin/alfred cap_net_admin,cap_net_raw+ep
